    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96227" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στᾰλ-άω</span></b> ,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταλάσσω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<i>let drop, let fall</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκρυ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Maiist.
					43
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.552
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1064
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴγειροι τὸ ἤλεκτρον ἐπ᾽ αὐτέῳ
					δάκρυον σταλάουσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Astr.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			; of snakes, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοίγια σταλάουσι σὺν αἵματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Androm.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.37
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταλάοντα ὄμματα</span>, with
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκρυα</span> unexpressed, cj. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.236
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>drop, drip</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				962
			</span></i>.</div>
